 radiation therapy. Outside of work, Dr. Stanton is an avid equestrian and skier and enjoys spending time with friends and family.\nVeterinarians\nOur veterinarians are a team of highly trained individuals dedicated to the health and well-being of your pets. Explore our veterinarians' biographies and learn about the individuals who make our hospital an excellent choice for your pets' care.\nAll\nAll\nEmergency & Critical Care\nNeurology\nRadiation Oncology\nSurgery\nLacie Acosta\nStaff Veterinarian\nDVM\nSteven Baker\nVeterinary Specialist\nDVM, MS, DACVS-SA\nBryen Ballard\nStaff Veterinarian\nDVM\nKaitlynn Bednarski\nStaff Veterinarian\nDVM\nDaniel Biggs\nStaff Veterinarian\nDVM\nCheyenne Campbell\nStaff Veterinarian\nDVM\nSandy Chen\nVeterinarian Specialist - Neurology\nBVM, DACVIM (Neurology)\nCameron Higgs\nStaff Veterinarian\nDVM\nChristopher Kellogg\nStaff Veterinarian\nDVM\nKay Preston\nStaff Veterinarian\nDVM\nKatie Strong\nStaff Veterinarian\nDVM\nMichaela Underwood\nStaff Veterinarian\nDVM\nJoin Our Newsletter\nWe just need a bit more information from you to complete your newsletter subscription.\nEmail*\nFirst Name*\nLast Name*\nBy signing up, you agree to our\nTerms and Conditions\nand\nPrivacy Policy\n.\n(Honey Pot Hidden Field)\nAppointment booking is not available this time\nPlease contact your hospital directly to schedule\nClose\nVCA Veterinary Specialty & Emergency Center of Kalamazoo\nLocation\n5348 S. Westnedge Avenue\nPortage, MI 49002\nPhone:\n269-381-5228\nHours & Info\nDays\nHours\nMon - Sun:\nOpen 24 hours\nVCA Animal Hospitals\nAbout Us\nContact Us\nFind A Hospital\nLocation Directory\nPress Center\nSocial Responsibility\nCareer Opportunities\nOpens in New Window\nGrow With Us\nOur Hospital\nOur Hospital\nDepartments\nOur Team\nYour Visit\nFor Veterinarians\nKnow Your Pet\nContact Us\nmyVCA\nAccount Overview\nManage Pet Profiles\nManage Subscriptions\nRefill Prescriptions\nPatient Documents\nPurchase & Invoice History\nVeterinary Recommenda